     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><font size=\"4\"><b><i>Hi;</i></b></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:garamond,serif;color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><font size=\"4\"><b><i>I am starting to learn ggplot2, can you instruct me how i can load or it is including the R ?</i></b></font></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, Aug 19, 2016 at 6:46 PM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #d3d3d3;max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:#333333\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/ggplot2/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#333333\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/ggplot2/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367772548000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0JOEAEwVfJGJus2xizoX7T\">\r\n              ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:20px/24px arial\"><a style=\"color:#dd4b39;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3