     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Section 1.5.2 here tells you what to do to get started with all of the tidyverse including ggplot2. <div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://r4ds.had.co.nz/introduction.html#getting-help-and-learning-more\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r4ds.had.co.nz/introduction.html%23getting-help-and-learning-more&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367772551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Pv8u01nPNbfJAP2PNgX5z\">http://r4ds.had.co.nz/introduction.html#getting-help-and-learning-more</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>Download R and install packages according to those instructions. Then once you&#39;ve done that read through to Chapter 3: <a href=\"http://r4ds.had.co.nz/data-visualisation.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r4ds.had.co.nz/data-visualisation.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367772551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2G5BEYhuDogRgUuaITTnPI\">http://r4ds.had.co.nz/data-visualisation.html</a></div><div><br></div><div>The R4DataScience chapters should get you started. There is also a new version of the ggplot2 book.</div><div><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/ggplot2-Elegant-Graphics-Data-Analysis/dp/331924275X/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.amazon.com/ggplot2-Elegant-Graphics-Data-Analysis/dp/331924275X/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367772551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ez1W7VE4L0mBlr5tLhtqj\">https://www.amazon.com/ggplot2-Elegant-Graphics-Data-Analysis/dp/331924275X/</a> </div><div><br></div><div>If you&#39;re struggling with specific issues, please see </div><div><a href=\"http://adv-r.had.co.nz/Reproducibility.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://adv-r.had.co.nz/Reproducibility.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367772551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28y5iEt3BucZSMAvvwaMTr\">http://adv-r.had.co.nz/Reproducibility.html</a><br></div><div>for how to post a fully working example of your issue so this group can understand what you have and what you want.</div><div><br></div><div>Lastly, good luck. </div><div><br></div><div>B</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
